   'adolescent&rsquo;s assent is part of the decision, and her priorities may settle it.</p></div>\n'
   '{{key:Start early, recommend clearly, prepare in parallel, and write the decision down where every unit can see it.}}\n'
   '{{call:<ul><li>Potassium rising despite diet and medicines, or electrocardiogram (ECG) changes</li><li>Fluid overload or hypertension that does not respond to '
   'treatment</li><li>Persistent vomiting, weight loss or a falling height velocity in a child near the dialysis range</li><li>A family being '
